text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">109 Units</p></div></div><!----><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white"><lucide-icon class="h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]"><path d="M15 3h6v6" key="1q9fwt"/><path d="m21 3-7 7" key="1l2asr"/><path d="m3 21 7-7" key="tjx5ai"/><path d="M9 21H3v-6" key="wtvkvv"/></svg></lucide-icon></div><div><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Project Area</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">2 Acres</p></div></div><!----><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white"><lucide-icon class="h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]"><path d="M16.051 12.616a1 1 0 0 1 1.909.024l.737 1.452a1 1 0 0 0 .737.535l1.634.256a1 1 0 0 1 .588 1.806l-1.172 1.168a1 1 0 0 0-.282.866l.259 1.613a1 1 0 0 1-1.541 1.134l-1.465-.75a1 1 0 0 0-.912 0l-1.465.75a1 1 0 0 1-1.539-1.133l.258-1.613a1 1 0 0 0-.282-.866l-1.156-1.153a1 1 0 0 1 .572-1.822l1.633-.256a1 1 0 0 0 .737-.535z" key="1m8t9f"/><path d="M8 15H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" key="l9tmp8"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4" key="e45bow"/></svg></lucide-icon></div><div><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Ownership</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Freehold</p></div></div><!----><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white"><lucide-icon class="h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]"><path d="M12 10h.01" key="1nrarc"/><path d="M12 14h.01" key="1etili"/><path d="M12 6h.01" key="1vi96p"/><path d="M16 10h.01" key="1m94wz"/><path d="M16 14h.01" key="1gbofw"/><path d="M16 6h.01" key="1x0f13"/><path d="M8 10h.01" key="19clt8"/><path d="M8 14h.01" key="6423bh"/><path d="M8 6h.01" key="1dz90k"/><path d="M9 22v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3" key="cabbwy"/><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" key="1uxh74"/></svg></lucide-icon></div><div><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Towers / Floors</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800"> 1 Towers  <!----> / 30 Floors <!----></p></div></div><!----><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white"><lucide-icon class="h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0" key="1nclc0"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" key="1v7zrd"/></svg></lucide-icon></div><div><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Property View</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Open View</p></div></div><!----><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white"><lucide-icon class="h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-4 w-4 text-[#1E5AA5]"><path d="M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2" key="5owen"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2" key="u2ysq9"/><path d="M9 17h6" key="r8uit2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2" key="axvx0g"/></svg></lucide-icon></div><div><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Parking</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Two Wheeler, Four Wheeler</p></div></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><hr class="my-5 border-slate-200"><div><div class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 transition-all duration-300 line-clamp-3">Welcome to Signia High, where luxury living reaches new heights. Signia High offers exquisite 1RK, 2, 3, 3.5 and 4 BHK residences that redefine opulence. Nestled in the heart of luxury, Signia High combines world-class amenities with spacious, beautiful homes, ensuring an unparalleled living experience.<br><br>Each residence is meticulously crafted, boasting grand living spaces and breathtaking views from sun decks, providing residents with a taste of heaven. The clubhouse is a hub of indoor recreation, offering limitless opportunities for leisure and entertainment. Whether you seek relaxation or excitement, Signia High caters to your every need.<br><br>Embrace the epitome of luxury living, where every detail is designed to exceed your expectations. At Signia High, you'll revel in the lavishness of king-sized living, where every moment is a celebration of indulgence and sophistication. Experience the pinnacle of luxury living at Signia High, where you'll find the perfect balance of opulence and comfort.</div><button type="button" class="mt-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:text-primary" jsaction="click:;"> Read More <lucide-icon class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300" ngh="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24"